Calculates freeze index, freezeband, motorband, and total power of a given time-series signal. FI is calculated using a hanning window convolution based on methods of Cockx et al. (2023) Journal of NeuroEngineering and Rehabilitation. 
        
        Parameters
        ----------
        data : array_like
            The input data as a one-dimensional array.
        fs: int
            Sampling frequency of the data.
        window: int
            Window length in seconds.

        Returns
        -------

        freeze_index, freeze_band, motor_band, total_power: array_like
            one-dimensional arrays, and can be accessed using the properties freeze_index,
            freeze_band, motor_band, and total_power as dot notation on the class object.
